{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDExLS0yMDE1L0klMjBBbSUyME51bWJlciUyMEZvdXIlMjAlMjgyMDExJTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"I Am Number Four","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/tPxc7Bb5ZTSFMlCjYxzVWOVy8gD.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lR8eHumEoL8FkszpDvbEUZRXVt5.jpg","description":"A teenage fugitive with an incredible secret races to stay one step ahead of the mysterious forces seeking destroy him. With three dead and one on the run, the race to find the elusive Number Four begins. Outwardly normal teen John Smith never gets too comfortable in the same identity, and along with his guardian, Henri, he is constantly moving from town to town. With each passing day, John gains a stronger grasp on his extraordinary new powers, and his bond to the beings that share his fantastic fate grows stronger.","releaseInfo":"2011","genres":["Action","Thriller","Science Fiction","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"6.2","runtime":"109 min","cast":["Alex Pettyfer","Dianna Agron","Teresa Palmer","Timothy Olyphant","Kevin Durand","Callan McAuliffe","Jake Abel","Garrett M. Brown"],"director":["D.J. Caruso"],"released":"2011-02-18T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"There were nine of us. Three are dead...","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Alex Pettyfer","character":"John Smith / Number Four","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/jcejkad2OWB71Bz1RRc4Ib0961k.jpg"},{"name":"Dianna Agron","character":"Sarah Hart","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/9BVahBiKoMKndboGFYQYtEd3RM4.jpg"},{"name":"Teresa Palmer","character":"Number Six / Maren Elizabeth","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/sjSiLSCp9LS1Z0nyGpmquTBuUyr.jpg"},{"name":"Timothy Olyphant","character":"Henri Smith","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/ccQzw9I1BYBv0HHVJr4cvAWjtkI.jpg"},{"name":"Kevin Durand","character":"Mogadorian Commander","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/hINvryvce5tpod6kTnUg9ZTH8wg.jpg"},{"name":"Callan McAuliffe","character":"Sam Goode","phot